# AICL Example: Last Even
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Last even elem

Layer:
Core

Behavior Find
    Input: array
    Output: result
    Action:
        result = -1
        for i in range(0, len(array)):
            if array[i] % 2 == 0:
                result = array[i]
        return result
